{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1761424301_97249_08f506329dc67eb2b895e5a84fd77142.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"293\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">💖 About Our Brand and Products</h3><p data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"706\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Kawaii Slime Company is a whimsical, trend-setting toy brand that turns creativity into a sensory adventure! Founded in 2017, we handcraft premium, safe, and ultra-aesthetic slime and DIY sensory toys that spark joy for kids, teens, and “kidults” everywhere. Each product is designed to be an experience — from collectible themes and deliciously scented textures to limited-edition collabs and magical unboxings.</p><hr data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"711\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h3 data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"744\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">✨ What Makes Us Different</h3><p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"819\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">We don’t just sell slime — we create moments of<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><em data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"817\">pure kawaii happiness.</em></p><ul data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"1394\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"980\"><p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"980\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"848\">Award-winning designs:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Our slimes are known for their stunning visuals, satisfying textures, and collectible packaging (like our Signature Dome Slime™).</p></li><li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1130\"><p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1130\"><strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1003\">Authentic brand:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>With over<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;3</span><strong data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1047\">&nbsp;million YouTube subscribers</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>and worldwide recognition, Kawaii Slime Company leads the sensory-play movement.</p></li><li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1292\"><p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1292\"><strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1168\">Disney &amp; Sanrio collaborations:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>We partner with beloved global brands, giving our community exclusive, licensed collections you can’t find anywhere else.</p></li><li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1394\"><p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1319\">Handmade in the USA:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Each batch is mixed, colored, and packaged with care in our Nevada studio.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1399\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h3 data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1433\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">💰 How Affiliates Can Earn</h3><p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1540\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Joining the Kawaii Slime Company Affiliate Program means you earn money simply by sharing what you love!</p><ul data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"2036\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1636\"><p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1636\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1563\">Base commission:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1576\">15%</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>on every sale generated through your unique link or code.</p></li><li data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1808\"><p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1808\"><strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1747\">Special promotions:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Seasonal bonuses and campaign rewards throughout the year.</p></li><li data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1914\"><p data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1914\"><strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1837\">Custom discount codes:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Your followers get an exclusive<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1881\">15% off</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>— making it easier to convert.</p></li><li data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"2036\"><p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2036\"><strong data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1940\">Automatic tracking:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Our system credits all sales within a<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2003\">30-day cookie window</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>so you never miss your earnings.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2041\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h3 data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2069\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">📣 How to Promote Us</h3><p data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2195\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">We love creativity — so bring your sparkle! Affiliates can share Kawaii Slime Company across any platform where they shine:</p><ul data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2582\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2293\"><p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2293\">Create TikToks, Reels, or YouTube videos showcasing our unboxings, textures, or themed drops.</p></li><li data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2371\"><p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2371\">Post aesthetic photos, hauls, and sensory ASMR on Instagram or Pinterest.</p></li><li data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2448\"><p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2448\">Add your affiliate link to blog posts, Linktrees, or video descriptions.</p></li><li data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2582\"><p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2582\">Share your code with friends, family, and online communities who love crafts, kawaii collectibles, or satisfying sensory content.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2702\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">💡<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><em data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2593\">Tip:</em><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Our top affiliates mix creative storytelling with authentic reactions — that’s what drives real conversions!</p><hr data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2707\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h3 data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2735\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">🌈 Other Information</h3><ul data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"3236\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2820\"><p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2820\"><strong data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2750\">Payouts:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Monthly via PayPal once your balance reaches the minimum threshold.</p></li><li data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2939\"><p data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2939\"><strong data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2835\">Support:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>You’ll have access to affiliate resources, launch calendars, and sneak peeks of upcoming collections.</p></li><li data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3056\"><p data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3056\"><strong data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2958\">Eligibility:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>We welcome influencers, small creators, slime enthusiasts, and anyone who loves kawaii culture.</p></li><li data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3236\"><p data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3236\"><strong data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3074\">Compliance:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Please disclose affiliate partnerships in accordance with FTC guidelines and stick to our brand style guide (family-friendly, positive, kawaii (cute) energy only 💕).</p></li></ul></div>",
